| Rust instrumented | `7b29d4b23c71bd75b8af0f114072106b4aa29458`, binary `integration_db-57b81b4013c86819` | Rust 1.88.0 / LLVM 20.1.5; fmt/Clippy, 447 workspace passed, 0 failed, 3 ignored; scoped sync PG 20 passed/37 ignored; native TLS один passed |
